[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/618667796","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1011#issuecomment-618667796","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1011","id":618667796,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYxODY2Nzc5Ng==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-04-23T21:00:32Z","updated_at":"2020-04-23T21:00:32Z","body":"This is one of the three OHL version 2.0 variants (-S is strongly reciprocal; -W in #1010 is weakly reciprocal and -P in #1009 is permissive). \r\n\r\nVersions [1.1](https://spdx.org/licenses/CERN-OHL-1.1.html) and [1.2](https://spdx.org/licenses/CERN-OHL-1.2.html) are already on the SPDX license list and appear to be widely used. The Open Source Hardware Association lists the OHL family of licenses among [popular licenses for sharing hardware designs](https://www.oshwa.org/sharing-best-practices/) (though to be fair I can't tell whether that was meant to be the -2.0 variants, since they just describe it as a \"copyleft\" license).\r\n\r\nI'm strongly in favor of adding these three variants. @kemitchell has already added a PR for these at #1015 -- I have a question in that thread about the version numbering (2 vs. 2.0 vs. 2.0.0) but I'm hoping @andrewjskatz can address.\r\n\r\nAssuming the version numbering is addressed -- can we get some +1's from other participants, so that we can hopefully get consensus to merge this in for 3.9? Or speak up with any concerns. \r\n\r\ncc'ing some usual suspects: @jlovejoy @MarkAtwood @bradleeedmondson @vmbrasseur @johnmhoran ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/618667796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/619235741","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1011#issuecomment-619235741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/1011","id":619235741,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYxOTIzNTc0MQ==","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events